  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Risk, Resilience and Regulatory Lab (R3LAB)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FSD Africa launched R3Lab in March 2022 to address regulatory and supervisory challenges such as regulating innovation and other emerging risks through collaboration and cooperation. R3Lab platform is intended to develop and create an enabling regulatory environment by encouraging and facilitating regulatory and supervisory interactions between insurance regulators in Africa. R3Lab is also focused to offer customized capacity-building programs, peer to peer exchange platform, comprehensive learning toolkits, a resource center, data collection and reporting and topical taskforces and forums for insurance supervisors in Africa.</narrative>
  </description>
